# Implementation Plan

## Goal
Implement the highest-value canonical schema cleanup safely by adding external source/sync adapter tables, moving ShopSite sync state out of `products`, consolidating `migration_log` consumers onto `integration_sync_runs`, fixing local seeds, and documenting schema ownership while staging the full migration squash for a follow-up PR.

